{
	"name": "Bohemian",
	"type": "background",
	"img": "icons/environment/wilderness/camp-improvised.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Ability Score Increases.</strong> +1 to Charisma and one other ability score.</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiencies.</strong> Your choice of one artisan’s tool kit or one musical instrument.</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies.</strong> Culture and either Deception or Persuasion.</p><p><strong>Suggested Equipment (cost 50 gp).</strong> Entertainer’s pack, painter’s supplies. </p><p><em><strong>Feature:</strong></em><strong> Devotee of the Arts.</strong> Whether you’re known as an artistic vagabond or a revolutionary of the craft, you are held in high regard in certain social circles. You gain an expertise die to any checks made to meet with important persons within the boundaries of your Prestige Center. </p><p><em><strong>Adventures and Advancement:</strong></em><strong> Revolutionary Artist.</strong> As tales of your talent spreads, people begin to seek you out to learn from you or to simply bask in your artistic greatness. They may even share important information with you in hopes of getting into your good graces. The amount of time it takes for you to source Key Information within your Prestige Center is reduced by half.</p><p><strong>Connection and Memento.</strong> Roll 1d10, choose, or make up your own.</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.out-of-the-wilds.roll-tables.RollTable.gYBF1WXY7SanZ3kh caption=false cite=true rollable=true]</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.out-of-the-wilds.roll-tables.RollTable.tauj53A2fUX8ogJE caption=false cite=true rollable=true]</p>",
